    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837420/extras/82985e8bb74652bfbe9d7d552e13b0e0.avif?t=1719340768\" width=616 height=162 /></span><br><br>You play as a member of the renowned Zenti faction, a space and time travelling cult so powerful that the mention of their names turns armies around. <br>You wake up in your ship unsure of who you are or where you are. <br>You quickly find yourself on a strange planet known as Earth and must follow the orders of the Zenti.<br><br>This game is an adult visual novel with sandbox elements.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT AND MECHANICS:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel through locations in Time and Space<br></li><li>Meet and interact with interesting characters and find adult encounters,<br></li><li>Exciting music and sounds<br></li><li>Level up your character's skills<br></li><li>8K high quality renders</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel to modern day and be introduced to your companion, Liu Cheng.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837420/extras/fd03d3b73d172498bec03ee0c3793a37.avif?t=1719340768\" width=616 height=162 /></span><br>Liu Cheng, a fiesty young mixed race girl living in China. You are both drawn together for some strange unknown reason.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel to ancient Egypt and build a strong alliance with the Pharaoh.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837420/extras/b71475735cd780bb08a0717e82740498.avif?t=1719340768\" width=616 height=162 /></span><br>Egyptians are strong people. Travel to the ancient times and befriend the Pharaoh to gain strong allies.<br><br><br>Are you ready to become the Lord of Time?",
